'''Pochi''' (''ポチ'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pochi
|image = E 238.png
|appearance = [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500円 - 1,975円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has rather low stats, along with Single Attack and low range.

==Strategy==
Due to its rather low stats and especially single attack, this enemy is very pathetic and should be no trouble in killing. Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], or any of the other [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to make short work of it. Any [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] you may possess can also kill it even quicker, like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and/or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]].

